      "side": 1,
      "message": "Hi Colin, is it possible to get the clang version used here from soong?",
      "revId": "8ba2eb4bb6d45cc91f180f30c5f631280fe15e8b",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
    },
    {
      "unresolved": false,
      "key": {
        "uuid": "749c841b_5824a0b0",
        "filename": "/PATCHSET_LEVEL",
        "patchSetId": 2
      },
      "lineNbr": 0,
      "author": {
        "id": 1002751
      },
      "writtenOn": "2023-05-19T20:51:23Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "We could pass it as an environment variable to cc_genrule modules, but that seems like it would cause even more support problems for you.  Or you could add a filegroup in prebuilts/clang/host/linux-x86 to export the path to clang.  None of this will work when extra sandboxing is enabled in Soong or in Bazel though.\n\nCould this be done with a cc_object module with \"-E\" in cflags, similar to https://cs.android.com/android/platform/superproject/+/master:art/tools/cpp-define-generator/Android.bp;l\u003d39;drc\u003de10abe7d84ed44d61401d24073f01d1c7777e17c?",
      "parentUuid": "07549232_adf886e6",
      "revId": "8ba2eb4bb6d45cc91f180f30c5f631280fe15e8b",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
    },
    {
      "unresolved": false,
      "key": {
        "uuid": "fdfa0312_9ad055c9",
        "filename": "/PATCHSET_LEVEL",
        "patchSetId": 2
      },
      "lineNbr": 0,
      "author": {
        "id": 1058860
      },
      "writtenOn": "2023-05-22T16:43:49Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "\u003e None of this will work when extra sandboxing is enabled in Soong or in Bazel though.\n\nAgreed.\n\nThe usage (`-E` on the current clang) itself is fine.  We just want to avoid the additional hard-coding of the clang version.\n\nJiyong@, can you switch to using the cc_object as Colin suggested?",
      "parentUuid": "749c841b_5824a0b0",
      "revId": "8ba2eb4bb6d45cc91f180f30c5f631280fe15e8b",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
    },
    {
      "unresolved": true,
      "key": {
        "uuid": "6e7161b6_737e629d",
        "filename": "/PATCHSET_LEVEL",
        "patchSetId": 2
      },
      "lineNbr": 0,
